{
  "_doc": "Single catalog of skills this standard installs for BOTH Claude Code and Codex. Edit with scripts/add-skill, not by hand. 'local' = skills/<name>; 'vendor' = git submodule pinned by commit. Optional per-skill 'notes' record known issues; they are shown in Agent Hub and referenced by global/AGENTS.md. A local wrapper skill may declare 'upstream' {vendor, file}: its upstream.md symlink points at that pinned file and check-updates tracks it.",
